    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2500\u2500&quot;We've... swapped bodies?!&quot;<br><br>When a horny college student switches bodies with his sexy aunt,</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >can they keep up the act until they switch back?<br><br>\u25c6 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the perspectives of Yuto and his aunt as the story unfolds from their first-person points of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices during dialogues will affect how the story develops\u2014and determine the final ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Main Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Shimizu\u00a0Yui</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676460/extras/f13f6f930c6042f7f4bfd2a6eb363fc8.avif?t=1751002010\" width=293 height=398 /></span><br>Yuto\u2019s aunt and the main heroine. A stubborn office lady who just got married. She struggles with interacting with men and has the fashion sense of an old grandma. She has little to no interest in sex, and as a woman, she can\u2019t even feel sexual pleasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Jinguu\u00a0Aoi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676460/extras/8c67d983d347bd9471ae9541a6fa1c41.avif?t=1751002010\" width=293 height=398 /></span><br>Yuto\u2019s girlfriend. Sweet, understanding, and emotionally mature. She fell in love with Yuto after meeting him at university. An ideal girlfriend who accepts all of his flaws\u2014and loves doing naughty things with him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yamamoto\u00a0Yuto</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676460/extras/d4e6a7add6af7f60a0ed1927256587f6.avif?t=1751002010\" width=293 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The male protagonist. An average but horny university student who struggles with premature ejaculation\u2014a problem that causes him a lot of distress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purely a visual novel experience\u2014no item collection or minigames. Perfect for casual players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features over 10 sets of dynamic illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 50,000 words of story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare body-swap themed story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 4 different endings</p></li></ul>",
